Change files: release intent, one per PR, in cargo-rail's format
(`cargo rail change add <crates> --bump <none|patch|minor|major> -m
"<release note>"`). The note is for the user: start with a verb and end
with the app, `(signal)` or `(session)`.

The files dated before Signal came here from Studio (2026-11-17) came
from Studio's .changes with these crates' lines; Studio keeps the lines
for its own crates.

This file has no .md extension on purpose: cargo-rail reads every .md
here as a change file.
